/P 442 0 R
/E (To treat BYE, the only solution is a beach holiday. For mild cases, a $3,000 trip per year is required and for severe cases, a $9,000 trip is required. It is recommended that patients moving from mild to severe, have a one-time treatment at progression of upgrading to a private jet for $35,000.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
480 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
