/Pg 9 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
481 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 442 0 R
/E (Dr. Grooves develop a 5-state Markov model: \(1\) Well, \(2\) Mild, \(3\) Severe, \(4\) Disease Death and \(4\) [All Cause] Death based on the data provided above. He said he used a 3% discounting rate for both costs and QALYs, and half-cycle correction on the model. All costs were converted into the same year. He is hoping to find the life-time impacts of BYE.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
